                <div class="neighborhood-prediction">
                    <h3>Property Value Prediction</h3>
                    <p>Based on current trends and upcoming developments, properties in this neighborhood are expected
                        to appreciate by <strong>
                            <%= (Math.random() * 15 + 10).toFixed(1) %>%
                        </strong> over the next 5 years.</p>

                    <div class="prediction-slider">
                        <div class="slider-header">
                            <span>Value Appreciation Potential</span>
                            <div class="prediction-rating">
                                <div class="prediction-bar">
                                    <% const predictionWidth=Math.floor(Math.random() * 30 + 70); %>
                                        <div class="prediction-fill" data-width="<%= predictionWidth %>"></div>
                                </div>
                                <span class="prediction-label">High</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="investment-analysis">
                        <h4>Investment Analysis</h4>
                        <table class="analysis-table">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Timeframe</th>
                                    <th>Estimated Value</th>
                                    <th>Appreciation</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <% 
                                const priceValue = 500000; // Base price value
                                const annualRate = (Math.random() * 0.04 + 0.03); // 3-7% annual appreciation
                                const years = [1, 3, 5, 10]; 
                                years.forEach(year => {
                                    const appreciatedValue = priceValue * Math.pow(1 + annualRate, year);
                                    const appreciationPct = (Math.pow(1 + annualRate, year) - 1) * 100;
                                %>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>
                                            <%= year %>
                                                <%= year===1 ? 'Year' : 'Years' %>
                                        </td>
                                        <td>$<%= appreciatedValue.toFixed(0).replace(/\B(?=(\d{3})+(?!\d))/g, "," ) %>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="appreciation-cell">+<%= appreciationPct.toFixed(1) %>%</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <% }); %>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="toggle-container">
                    <div class="toggle-header" onclick="toggleContent('marketInsights')">
                        <span>Market Insights</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div id="marketInsights" class="toggle-content">
                        <div class="insights-content">
                            <p>The <%= property.location.split(',')[0] %> area has shown strong resilience in the real
                                    estate market over the past few years. Properties in this neighborhood typically
                                    sell for <%= (Math.random() * 10 + 95).toFixed(1) %>% of the listing price,
                                        indicating a <%= Math.random()> 0.5 ? "seller's" : "balanced" %> market.</p>

                            <div class="insights-grid">
                                <div class="insight-item">
                                    <h4>Supply & Demand</h4>
                                    <p>The current inventory of available properties in this area is <strong>
                                            <%= (Math.random() * 0.4 + 0.2).toFixed(1) %>
                                        </strong> months, suggesting <%= Math.random()> 0.6 ? "high" : "moderate" %>
                                            demand relative to supply.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="insight-item">
                                    <h4>Price Per Square Foot</h4>
                                    <p>The average price per square foot in this area is <strong>$<%= (Math.random() *
                                                100 + 200).toFixed(0) %></strong>, which is <%= Math.random()> 0.5 ?
                                            "above" : "comparable to" %> the city average.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="insight-item">
                                    <h4>Rental Yield</h4>
                                    <p>Properties in this neighborhood generate an average rental yield of <strong>
                                            <%= (Math.random() * 2 + 4).toFixed(1) %>%
                                        </strong>, making it an <%= (Math.random() * 2 + 4)> 5 ? "attractive" :
                                            "average" %> investment opportunity.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="insight-item">
                                    <h4>Future Development</h4>
                                    <p>Upcoming infrastructure and commercial development projects are expected to
                                        positively impact property values in this area over the next 3-5 years.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

